*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : CRD0024
*> PURPOSE : CREDIT APPROVAL RULES
*> AUTHOR  : J.K.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1987-09-15 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-12-08 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 851
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB CRDNIGHT STEP010
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CRD0024.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    COPY CRD0024C.
01 WS-RESULTS.
    *> ASSIGNED CREDIT LIMIT
    05 APPROVED-LIMIT     PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM 3000-CREDIT-LIMIT
    DISPLAY "APPROVED-LIMIT=" APPROVED-LIMIT
    STOP RUN.
3000-CREDIT-LIMIT.
    EVALUATE TRUE
        *> PRIME CREDIT LIMIT - LIMIT 570 PER 1998 POLICY
        WHEN BUREAU-SCORE >= 760
            COMPUTE APPROVED-LIMIT ROUNDED = ANN-INCOME * 0.30
        *> STANDARD CREDIT LIMIT - LIMIT 1020 PER 1998 POLICY
        WHEN BUREAU-SCORE >= 680
            COMPUTE APPROVED-LIMIT = ANN-INCOME * 0.15
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 500 TO APPROVED-LIMIT
    END-EVALUATE.
